{"id":"4c072e6a1aee9fc9","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-term-metric-complete.md","title":"项树度量的完备性","display":"thm-term-metric-complete — 项树度量的完备性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-term-metric-complete","aliases":["56-thm-term-metric-complete"],"display":"thm-term-metric-complete — 项树度量的完备性","depends_on":["[[56-df-metric-on-terms]]","[[56-df-infinite-term]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Theorem 12.2.1 and proof, printed p671","source_ocr_block":"692","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-read; local-proof-outline-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-term-metric-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-term-metric-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-term-metric-complete — 项树度量的完备性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"abe5105dc83b1e79\" href=\"?note=abe5105dc83b1e79\" title=\"56-df-metric-on-terms\">56-df-metric-on-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef3a31528875d9d3\" href=\"?note=ef3a31528875d9d3\" title=\"56-df-infinite-term\">56-df-infinite-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Theorem 12.2.1 and proof, printed p671"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"692"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-read; local-proof-outline-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"abe5105dc83b1e79\" href=\"?note=abe5105dc83b1e79\" title=\"56-df-metric-on-terms\">56-df-metric-on-terms</a> 中首差度量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm{fin}}=\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T^{\\mathrm{fin}}=\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ef3a31528875d9d3\" href=\"?note=ef3a31528875d9d3\" title=\"56-df-infinite-term\">56-df-infinite-term</a> 中全部有限项树的集合。变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 非空。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t=(t_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathbf t=(t_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，每个序列分量仅在自然数下标处使用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 遍历正实数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall r,s,t\\in T^\\infty\\;(d(r,t)\\le\\max\\{d(r,s),d(s,t)\\}),\\qquad\\forall s,t\\in T^\\infty\\;(d(s,t)=0\\Longleftrightarrow s=t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall r,s,t\\in T^\\infty\\;(d(r,t)\\le\\max\\{d(r,s),d(s,t)\\}),\\qquad\\forall s,t\\in T^\\infty\\;(d(s,t)=0\\Longleftrightarrow s=t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathbf t\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\Bigl((\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(m\\ge N\\land n\\ge N\\Longrightarrow d(t_m,t_n)&lt;\\varepsilon))\\Longrightarrow\\exists t\\in T^\\infty\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge N\\Longrightarrow d(t_n,t)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\mathbf t\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\Bigl((\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(m\\ge N\\land n\\ge N\\Longrightarrow d(t_m,t_n)&lt;\\varepsilon))\\Longrightarrow\\exists t\\in T^\\infty\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge N\\Longrightarrow d(t_n,t)&lt;\\varepsilon)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall t\\in T^\\infty\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists u\\in T^{\\mathrm{fin}}\\;(d(t,u)&lt;\\varepsilon).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall t\\in T^\\infty\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists u\\in T^{\\mathrm{fin}}\\;(d(t,u)&lt;\\varepsilon).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 12.2.1 及其证明（印刷 p671，OCR 页块692），本次已读证明。Cauchy 性保证每个有限深度的标签最终稳定；逐位置取稳定标签形成合法树并给出极限。共同前缀的最小稳定深度给出强三角不等式。有限项稠密：在足够深处截断有限分支树，并以一个固定变量替换截断叶子。有限元数保证每个截断层有限。因此本节点同时给出“完备空间＋有限项稠密”，即原书度量完备化结论的具体内容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-metric-on-terms","status":"resolved","id":"abe5105dc83b1e79","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-metric-on-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-infinite-term","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a31528875d9d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-infinite-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-metric-on-terms","status":"resolved","id":"abe5105dc83b1e79","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$d$ 为 [[56-df-metric-on-terms]] 中首差度量；$T^{\\mathrm{fin}}=\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 取 [[56-df-infinite-term]] 中全部有限项树的集合。变量集 $\\mathcal V$ 非空。$\\mathbf t=(t_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\mathbb N}$，每个序列分量仅在自然数下标处使用；$\\varepsilon$ 遍历正实数。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-infinite-term","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a31528875d9d3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$d$ 为 [[56-df-metric-on-terms]] 中首差度量；$T^{\\mathrm{fin}}=\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 取 [[56-df-infinite-term]] 中全部有限项树的集合。变量集 $\\mathcal V$ 非空。$\\mathbf t=(t_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\mathbb N}$，每个序列分量仅在自然数下标处使用；$\\varepsilon$ 遍历正实数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T^\\infty=\\mathcal T^\\infty(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm{fin}}=\\mathcal T_{\\mathrm{tree}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf t=(t_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall r,s,t\\in T^\\infty\\;(d(r,t)\\le\\max\\{d(r,s),d(s,t)\\}),\\qquad\\forall s,t\\in T^\\infty\\;(d(s,t)=0\\Longleftrightarrow s=t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\mathbf t\\in(T^\\infty)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\Bigl((\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(m\\ge N\\land n\\ge N\\Longrightarrow d(t_m,t_n)<\\varepsilon))\\Longrightarrow\\exists t\\in T^\\infty\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\ge N\\Longrightarrow d(t_n,t)<\\varepsilon)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall t\\in T^\\infty\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists u\\in T^{\\mathrm{fin}}\\;(d(t,u)<\\varepsilon).","display":true}],"bytes":2152,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-311","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-term-metric-complete.md]]"}],"outgoing":["abe5105dc83b1e79","ef3a31528875d9d3"]}